                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The bipartisan Youth Mental Health Research Act\u00a0would fund social, behavioral, cognitive, and developmental research to improve how we identify and care for youth at risk, and deliver mental health interventions in clinical and community settings where youth live, play, work, and learn.\nhttps://t.co/r4zW2ulcY7",
