                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Unless Congress acts, the tax credits that help working families afford health care will expire.\u00a0Millions of people will see their premiums soar and many will lose care altogether, including cancer patients and people with chronic diseases.\n\nIf Congressional Republicans force these tax credits to expire, everyone \u2013 even people who don\u2019t get the tax credits now \u2013 will pay higher premiums.\n\nWe need Republicans to stop their attacks on health care, extend these critical tax credits, and reverse their disastrous Medicaid cuts.",
