                "quoted_status_profile_username": "RepDean",
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thank  you @RepDean.\n\nRFK Jr and Linda McMahon's disregard of mental health services for our youth is dangerous. \n\nYoung people are 21x more likely to seek care for mental health reasons if they have access to school-based services. Yet McMahon and others are cutting mental health resources for young people.",
