                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 2019, I chaired a taskforce to examine why suicide was on the rise for certain groups of children and how we could reverse this trend. \n\nWe identified mental health screenings as a solution that increases\u00a0the likelihood of connecting students with the services that they may need, mental health or otherwise. Screening can identify problems that may not be immediately apparent, but can lead to problems down the road.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1758572514,
                "view_count": 372
