                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If Trump gets his way, 32,000 people in the 12th District would see their premiums go up by between $2500 and $11,000 for the average family.\n\n26,000 people will lose health coverage altogether because of Republican cuts to NJ FamilyCare in the Big Billionaire Bailout Law and their plot to gut the Affordable Care Act.\n\nStill, Trump refuses to meet with Democrats to avoid these cuts and keep the government open.",
