                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "At a time when America is facing a mental health crisis, Donald Trump is doing everything he can to exacerbate the problem. \n\nSo far this year he's cut the workforce tackling this issue IN HALF! Including 125 on World Mental Health Day.\n\nhttps://t.co/EYqQC7lk8h",
